# Safety and integrity

This file is hash-locked.

## Never invent

- citations, DOI, PMID, PMCID
- affinity, kon, koff, EC50, LOD, dynamic range, n, response time, or other experimental numbers
- “full text inspected” when only an abstract or another agent’s note was read

If a value is missing, leave the field empty and tag the claim `unresolved` or omit the claim.

## Git hygiene

- Never commit credentials, API keys, or `.env` files
- Never commit copyrighted PDFs
- Abstracts, OA HTML excerpts quoted sparingly for locators, and bibliographic metadata are allowed

## Human approval

A thesis is not group-final until a human records approval in `state/decisions.md`.

Agents may recommend a best-current thesis in `poster/theses.md` and `reports/nightly_summary.md`.

## Recursion limit

Do not implement uncontrolled recursive self-modification.

Meta-improver may propose prompt/workflow patches only. It may not edit this file, the research constitution, or the scoring rubric.

## Poster freeze

Do not produce a polished final poster in this swarm run.
